From: akallabeth <akallabeth@posteo.net>
Date: Fri, 9 Jan 2026 09:18:24 +0100
Subject: [channels,rdpecam] add value range checks
Origin: upstream, https://github.com/FreeRDP/FreeRDP/commit/508a0db07c8216e86edd1ce7f7f8398342868a91
Forwarded: not-needed
Comment:

When reading a enum value from network, first check the value range and
abort with a log message if an invalid value is found
